* `groups`: An object containing different groups of hosts with their associated variables and child groups.
* `hosts`: An array of hostnames within a group.
* `vars`: An object containing variables to be assigned to hosts within a group.
* `children`: An array of child groups whose hosts will be added to the current group.
* `_meta`: An object containing metadata about the inventory, including a `hostvars` object that maps hostnames to their variables.

