3. `oneOf`: A non-terminal representing a choice between multiple components.
4. `anyOf`: A non-terminal representing a combination of components where any of the components can be used.
5. `allOf`: A non-terminal representing a combination of components where all components must be used.
6. `sequence`: A non-terminal representing a sequence of components.
7. `function`: A non-terminal representing a function call with a type and arguments.

