  - type: The type of resource, which is always "Microsoft.ServerManagement/nodes".
  - location: The location of the resource.
  - name: The name of the resource.
  - properties: An object containing additional properties specific to the node resource, including the ID of the gateway to which the node belongs and the name of the node to connect to.

- Sessions:
  - apiVersion: The version of the API to be used.
  - type: The type of resource, which can be either "Microsoft.ServerManagement/gateways/sessions" or "Microsoft.ServerManagement/nodes/sessions".
  - location: The location of the resource.
  - name: The name of the resource.
  - properties: An object containing the username and password for the session.

