- `$schema`: The version of the JSON schema used to define this configuration.
- `$tool`: The tool to be used for generating SVG patterns, which must be set to "svg-patterns."
- `dist`: The output file path (relative to the current working directory) where the generated file will be saved. Supported file types are .ts, .js, and .json.
- `url`: The target URL of the raw Patterns-Gallery HTML page, which defaults to "https://gitcdn.xyz/repo/progers/Patterns-Gallery/master/index.html" if not specified.

Here's the complete JSON object that conforms to the given schema:

```json
